# Altnera Email Verification API – Full Reference

> **Version:** v1.0  
> **Base URL:** `https://altnera.com/api`  
> **Auth:** `Authorization: Bearer <API_KEY>`

Official reference for the Altnera Email Verification API. Validate and score email addresses using DNS, MX, SMTP, and heuristics.

---

## 🔑 Authentication

Send your API key on every request:

```
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY
```

If missing/invalid → `401 Unauthorized`.

You can manage/rotate your key at `/api/manage-key.php`.

---

## 📍 Endpoints

### 1) Verify Email

**POST** `/verify.php`

Validate a single email address.

**Request**
```http
POST /api/verify.php
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY
```

```json
{ "email": "name@company.com" }
```

**Response**
```json
{
  "email": "name@company.com",
  "status": "deliverable",
  "score": 0.92,
  "checks": {
    "syntax": true,
    "mxRecords": true,
    "dnsResolved": true,
    "smtp": false,
    "disposable": false,
    "roleAddress": false,
    "freeProvider": false
  },
  "domain": "company.com"
}
```

**Status values**: `deliverable` | `undeliverable` | `risky` | `unknown`

---

### 2) Bulk Verification

**POST** `/verify-bulk.php` *(optional server endpoint; client SDK also supports bulk fanout)*

**Request**
```http
POST /api/verify-bulk.php
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY
```
```json
{ "emails": ["a@x.com", "b@y.com"] }
```

**Response**
```json
{ "results": [ /* VerifyResponse[] */ ] }
```

