## ⚠️ Errors

| Code | Meaning |
|-----:|--------|
| 400 | Missing/invalid parameter (e.g., no `email`) |
| 401 | Unauthorized (missing/invalid key) |
| 403 | Forbidden (key disabled/no scope) |
| 405 | Method not allowed (use POST) |
| 429 | Too many requests (rate limit) |
| 500 | Internal server error |

**Error shape**
```json
{ "error": "Message here" }
```

